## Short description

This cardholder is a format of wallet that is just perfect. It's minimalist but yet has enough space for a lot of stuff.

## Long description

I love the balance between minimalism and the room you have in there. I did put easily 8 cards but could have make it 10, and some cash next to it.  
It fits into the pocket and is easy to open/close. And let's not talk about the great look.

## Details

Anyways, here is a Corsair Wallet made of Yellow thread and Pueblo leather in Ortensia. But you can ask to all the customisation you want. (almost)

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

